# Citation File Format 1.2.0
# https://citation-file-format.github.io
#
# Two authors: the attorney who maintains the dataset, and the firm.
#
# It was institutional-only at first, which meant GitHub's "Cite this
# repository" button and every formal citation named a company and no person.
# For a dataset whose whole claim is that a qualified lawyer stands behind the
# figures, that is the wrong omission: the README already names her, so the
# citation should too.
#
# In CFF an author is a person when it carries "given-names" and
# "family-names", and an entity when it carries "name". There is no "type"
# key in CFF 1.2.0, so the distinction is made by which keys are present.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Turkish Citizenship by Investment: Open Data"
abstract: >-
  Machine-readable reference data on Turkiye's citizenship-by-investment
  programme: qualifying investment thresholds and their statutory basis, the
  conditions attached to each route, government and third-party transaction
  costs, the documents an application requires, published statistics on
  citizenship acquisitions and foreign property purchases, and an index of the
  primary sources behind each figure. Figures are dated and attributed to the
  instrument or publication they come from.
authors:
  - family-names: "Sevimli"
    given-names: "Rüzgar"
    affiliation: "Ra Legal, Istanbul Bar Association"
    country: TR
  - name: "Ra Legal"
    city: "Istanbul"
    country: TR
    website: "https://ralegal.com.tr"
    email: "info@ralegal.com.tr"
version: 1.2.0
date-released: "2026-11-13"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ralegal/turkish-cbi-data"
url: "https://ralegal.com.tr/data/turkish-cbi-open-data"
keywords:
  - Turkiye
  - Turkish citizenship
  - citizenship by investment
  - investment migration
  - residence permit
  - real estate
  - open data
  - Law No. 5901
contact:
  - name: "Ra Legal"
    city: "Istanbul"
    country: TR
    email: "info@ralegal.com.tr"
